  "reply": "```python\nimport sys\n\n\ndef main():\n    with open(sys.argv[1], 'rb') as f:\n        data = f.read().split()\n    H = int(data[0])\n    W = int(data[1])\n    S = int(data[2])\n    rows = data[3:3 + H]\n\n    # Each cell is a 17-bit field in one big integer. Values never exceed 9000,\n    # and the neighbour sum is at most 8 * 9000 = 72000 < 2**17, so fields never carry.\n    B = 17\n    stride = W + 2\n    NF = (H + 2) * stride\n\n    kind = bytearray(NF)  # 0 = wall/outside, 1 = open '.', 2 = source\n    srcval = []\n    open_idx = []\n    for r in range(H):\n        row = rows[r]\n        base = (r + 1) * stride + 1\n        for c in range(W):\n            ch = row[c]\n            if ch == 46:  # '.'\n                kind[base + c] = 1\n                open_idx.append(base + c)\n            elif ch != 35:  # not '#': a digit source\n                kind[base + c] = 2\n                srcval.append((base + c, 1000 * (ch - 48)))\n\n    ZERO = '0' * B\n    ONE = '1' * B\n    ONE14 = '000' + '1' * 14  # keeps the low 14 bits after >>3\n\n    pMO = [ZERO] * NF\n    pU = [ZERO] * NF\n    pD = [ZERO] * NF\n    pL = [ZERO] * NF\n    pR = [ZERO] * NF\n    for p in open_idx:\n        pMO[p] = ONE14\n        if not kind[p - stride]:\n            pU[p] = ONE\n        if not kind[p + stride]:\n            pD[p] = ONE\n        if not kind[p - 1]:\n            pL[p] = ONE\n        if not kind[p + 1]:\n            pR[p] = ONE\n\n    pS = [ZERO] * NF\n    fmt = '0%db' % B\n    for p, v in srcval:\n        pS[p] = format(v, fmt)\n\n    def pack(pieces):\n        # pieces[i] is field i (MSB first within the field); the last piece is most significant.\n        pieces.reverse()\n        return int(''.join(pieces), 2)\n\n    MO = pack(pMO)\n    SRC = pack(pS)\n    NU = pack(pU)\n    ND = pack(pD)\n    NL = pack(pL)\n    NR = pack(pR)\n\n    SU = B * stride\n    X = SRC\n    for _ in range(S):\n        # Neighbour terms: shifted value if passable, own value otherwise.\n        # Walls and padding hold 0 in X, so the shifted value is 0 there.\n        T = ((X << 2) + (X << SU) + (X >> SU) + (X << B) + (X >> B)\n             + (X & NU) + (X & ND) + (X & NL) + (X & NR))\n        X = ((T >> 3) & MO) | SRC\n\n    NB = B * NF\n    s = format(X, 'b').zfill(NB)\n\n    total = 0\n    best = -1\n    bR = 0\n    bC = 0\n    chk = 0\n    for p in open_idx:\n        st = NB - (p + 1) * B\n        v = int(s[st:st + B], 2)\n        total += v\n        r = p // stride - 1\n        c = p % stride - 1\n        if v > best:\n            best = v\n            bR = r\n            bC = c\n        chk += v * (r * W + c + 1)\n\n    sys.stdout.write(\n        \"sum %d\\nmax %d %d %d\\nchecksum %d\\n\" % (total, best, bR, bC, chk)\n    )\n\n\nif __name__ == '__main__':\n    main()\n```",
